		<title>How I paid money into ex-CCT chairman&#8217;s wife&#8217;s account, covered his children&#8217;s school fees &#8211; Contractor</title>
		<link>https://www.premiumtimesng.com/news/top-news/921335-how-i-paid-money-into-ex-cct-chairmans-wifes-account-covered-his-childrens-school-fees-contractor.html</link>
					<comments>https://www.premiumtimesng.com/news/top-news/921335-how-i-paid-money-into-ex-cct-chairmans-wifes-account-covered-his-childrens-school-fees-contractor.html#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Falmata Daniel]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:12:51 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Top News]]></category>
